|type=class
|prereq=[[arcane archer]] 8
|desc=In lieu of a regular attack, once per day an arcane archer can fire an arrow at each and every target within range, to a maximum of one target for every arcane archer level he has.
|use=selected
|icon=ife_x1hailarr.gif
|class1=arcane archer
}}

==Notes==

*Added in the [[expansion pack]]s.
*Targets are chosen based on distance from the archer, with closer targets given preference.
*The range of this [[feat]] is the current [[area]], and there are no allowances made for visibility. Using this feat can cause many previously unseen [[creature]]s to come running.
*Each arrow fired makes a ranged [[touch attack]] to see if it hits (which, as usual for touch attacks, ignores [[zen archery]]).
*The [[piercing damage]] inflicted by a successful hit is the sum of weapon base damage ([[d6]] for a [[shortbow]] or d8 for a [[longbow]]), [[strength]] [[modifier]], [[weapon specialization]] (if applicable), and [[epic weapon specialization]] (if applicable).
** This damage is tripled in the case of a [[critical hit]].
* The damage penetrates [[damage reduction]] according to the arcane archer's [[enchant arrow]] bonus.
*A successful hit also deals [[magical damage]] equal to the arcane archer's enchant arrow bonus.

===Previous versions===

* Prior to [[patch]] 1.87.8193.35 ([[Neverwinter Nights Enhanced Edition]]), damage reduction was not penetrated, due to a bug in the engine (not the script).
*Prior to version 1.69, this feat did not account for ''epic weapon specialization''.

